## Review protocol

- **Distribute:** ≥48h before review (different time zones / org calendars).
- **Comment window:** opens on distribution, closes at meeting start.
- **Meeting:** 60 min; 10-15 min silent re-read first.
- **Async escalation:** if ≥2 round trips on any thread, schedule sync.
- **After Accepted:** both-side approvers named, decision-log row appended, first milestone scheduled within 1 week.
